    os._remove_dll_directory
    os._supports_virtual_terminal

Compiled only for other systems, so absent here:
    os.spawnv
    os.spawnve
    os.plock
    os.waitpid
    os.sendfile
    os._emscripten_debugger
    os._emscripten_log

One definition per target (names and tables suffixed _<target>;
the binding installs its own target's):
    os.getgrouplist: darwin
    os.getgrouplist: linux
