             "pipe2($module, flags, /)\n--\n\nCreate a pipe with flags set atomically.\n\nReturns a tuple of two file descriptors:\n  (read_fd, write_fd)\n\nflags can be constructed by ORing together one or more of these values:\nO_NONBLOCK, O_CLOEXEC.",
